### All jobs, paged
GET http://localhost:8083/jobs?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Get by id
GET http://localhost:8083/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8083/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}